13:04:38 said  The result is a complete Android app in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose that includes automatic location tagging and a map view for browsing entries, rich attachments for photos, videos, audio recordings, and handwritten signatures, automatic weather and motion/step logging per entry, scheduled daily reminders with notifications, and a monthly calendar with custom tags and mood selection/filtering.
