14:20:38 said  ## Original target opened (decompilation/analysis)
14:20:38 said  - Opened with `core_target_open`: `C:\Users\ali\Downloads\base.apk` (`com.journey.app`, 5.6.2-play, versionCode 758, minSdk 26, targetSdk 35, sha256 `c2029c5ebdf3…f7bf`, target `t_c2029c5ebdf3`).
14:20:38 said  - As requested, I attempted `native_strings_find` / `native_function_pseudocode`, but the original is an **Android APK (DEX bytecode), not native machine code** — `native_strings_find` returned *"An Android app is not native machine code"*. So the “functions behind what was built” were located and read via DEX/Android tools instead (`android_classes_find`, `android_class_show`, `android_method_show` smali-like disassembly), with all results awaited. Function addresses below are DEX method references with evidence IDs.
14:20:38 said  ## Functions/methods read (real values, formulas, rules)
14:20:38 said  **Reminders (receiver & scheduling)**
14:20:38 said  - `Lcom/journey/app/ReminderReceiver;->onReceive(Landroid/content/Context;Landroid/content/Intent;)V` (`ev_30ce1ac8…`) — `Calendar.DAY_OF_WEEK` (1=Sun..7=Sat) string checked against allowed days from `Ls8/T;->z0`; logs `Alarm: <day> | <days>` (`JourneyReminderReceiver`); if allowed calls `e(ctx)`.
14:20:38 said  - `Lcom/journey/app/ReminderReceiver;->e(Landroid/content/Context;)V` (`ev_0723f511…`) — notification path: checks `n1()`/notifications enabled; if `p1()` creates channel `"com.journey.app.reminder"` (name `LN7/X4;->Wa`, importance **4/HIGH**); builds/posts notification with content intents `c/d`, title/text/icon/color/actions/resources (`LN7/X4;->K5/Wa/D/I5`, `LN7/O4;->a`, `LN7/Q4;->T3/b4`), optional bitmap `b`/action `a`.
14:20:38 said  - `Ls8/a;->j(Landroid/content/Context;Ljava/lang/Boolean;)V` (`s8.a.j`, `ev_1d0bbbfb…`) — scheduler: `HOUR_OF_DAY = Ls8/T;->A0(ctx)`, `MINUTE = Ls8/T;->B0(ctx)`, `SECOND = 0`; if `time <= now` add `0x5265c00` (**86,400,000 ms**); `AlarmManager.setRepeating(type=1 /*RTC_WAKEUP*/, trigger, 0x5265c00, PI)`; logs `Reminder Set HR <h> MIN <m>` (`AlarmHelper`). If disabled: `cancel(pi)` + `pi.cancel()`.
14:20:38 said  - `Ls8/T;->A0` (`ev_ae99a9e8…`): pref `reminder_hour_2`, default **20**.
14:20:38 said  - `Ls8/T;->B0` (`ev_cc4e43d8…`): pref `reminder_min_2`, default **0**.
14:20:38 said  - `Ls8/T;->z0` (`ev_869ec36bd…`): pref `reminder_day_2` StringSet, default `{"1".."7"}` (Sun..Sat).
14:20:38 said  - `Ls8/T;->n1/o1/p1` (`ev_7ba579e7…`, `ev_be834da5…`, `ev_d40d60a8…`): return `true`.
14:20:38 said  **Entry/data model & schemas**
14:20:38 said  - `com.journey.app.mvvm.models.entity.JournalV2` (`ev_b7d2a3b9…`, 26 fields): `JId:long`, `DateOfJournal/Modified/Timezone:String`, `Text/PreviewText/Address:String`, `Lat/Lng:Double`, `Activity:Integer`, `Sentiment:Double`, `WeatherDegreeC:Double`, `WeatherDescription/Icon/Place:String`, `WeatherId:Integer`, `Favourite:Boolean`, etc. (accessors incl. `getActivity/getSentiment/getLat/getLng/getAddress/getDateOfJournal`).
14:20:38 said  - `com.journey.app.mvvm.models.entity.Journal` (`ev_c2b23ae3…`): includes `DateOfJournal:Long`, `Lat/Lon:Double`, `Mood:Integer`, `Sentiment:Double`, `WeatherDegreeC/Description/Icon/Id/Place`, `Address`, `Timezone`, etc.
14:20:38 said  - Sync schemas: `SyncApiGson$PartialEntryResponseGson` (`ev_46da14e4…`, `activity:Integer`, `sentiment:Double`, `location`, `weather`, `files`, `tags`, …), `EntryLocationResponseGson` (`ev_2c41159b…`, `lat/lng:Double`), `EntryWeatherResponseGson` (`ev_439291f1…`, `degreeC/description/icon/id/place`), `EntryFileResponseGson` (`ev_78de9865…`, `id/alias/ext/mimeType/createdAt/fileMetadataDate`). Tags/media entities observed (Tag/TagV2/TagWordBag*/Media/MediaFileV2, e.g. `ev_9550d2a6…`, `ev_791282ea…`).
14:20:38 said  ## Changes made to the build (to use these mechanics)
14:20:38 said  - **`app/MECHANICS.md`** — rewritten with the real values/formulas/rules and DEX function addresses + evidence IDs from this analysis (including the native-tool inapplicability note and remaining unknowns/estimates: mood UI scale mapping, exact `Activity` semantics, signature/storage & resource contents).
14:20:38 said  - **`app/app/src/main/java/com/journey/replica/reminders/ReminderScheduler.kt`** — aligned to observed scheduler mechanics: `RTC_WAKEUP` `AlarmManager.setRepeating` with interval `86_400_000L`, `HOUR_OF_DAY/MINUTE/SECOND=0`, roll-forward by 1 day if past, `cancel` + `pi.cancel` on disable; added `DEFAULT_HOUR=20`, `DEFAULT_MINUTE=0`, `DEFAULT_DAYS="1..7"` (mirroring `A0/B0/z0`/`j`). (Replica keeps per-reminder records rather than a single global pref.)
14:20:38 said  - **`app/app/src/main/java/com/journey/replica/reminders/ReminderReceiver.kt`** — aligned to `onReceive` day-gating rule (1=Sun..7=Sat, default days from observed `z0`), channel/importance usage aligned to `e` (`com.journey.app.reminder`, HIGH); removed per-fire reschedule since repeating is handled by `setRepeating` as observed.
14:20:38 said  - Existing replica already aligned on key values/types: channel `com.journey.app.reminder` + `IMPORTANCE_HIGH` (`JourneyReplicaApp`), `sentiment: Double?`, `activitySteps: Int?`, lat/lng+address, weather degreeC/description/icon/place, tags/attachments structures (see MECHANICS).
