15:15:46 said  - `Lcom/journey/app/ReminderReceiver;->e(Landroid/content/Context;)V` (`ev_ea931a1…`, 189 insns): checks notification permission flags (`Ls8/T;->n1()` / enabled check, logs `"Reminder: Notification blocked"` if blocked), creates channel `com.journey.app.reminder` with importance `4` (IMPORTANCE_HIGH) when `p1()` true, builds/posts the notification (content intents, title/text/color/icon/actions from resources, priority/visibility 2), notify id from resource `LN7/X4;->D`.
