15:15:46 said  - `Ls8/T;->A0(...)I` (`ev_4ec0d57…`): pref `reminder_hour_2`, **default 20**.
15:15:46 said  - `Ls8/T;->B0(...)I` (`ev_c65f928…`): pref `reminder_min_2`, **default 0**.
15:15:46 said  - `Ls8/T;->z0(...)TreeSet` (`ev_04af18f…`): default days loop `1..7` (`"1"`..`"7"`), reads `reminder_day_2` StringSet, returns sorted `TreeSet`.
